   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2005 a Memorandum of Understanding was signed by Sida and EBRD which laid down the arrangement for cooperation in municipal environment infrastructure projects in selected Early Transition Countries (ETC). In order to continuously safeguard Sida-polices and guidelines in the implementation of the projects, Sida has decided to use a consultant with knowledge of Sida to assist EBRD in its project</narrative>
